## 🚨 Kanban Team Boundaries

Work only on your own team's board items. Freelance agents work any platform item on their project's board. Before starting an item, confirm its team matches yours; if not, use the STOP Protocol above.

### **🚫 Kanban Data Modification Rules**
- All kanban operations go through the API: `kb-*` functions, the kanban MCP server, or the `/kanban` skill. Never edit `kanban-board.json`, board state files or kanban scripts directly (Academy excepted).
- ❌ **Do not delete items or subitems.** Cancel with a reason instead: `kb-cancel <ITEM-ID>` or `kb-backlog sub cancel <subitem-id> --reason "..."`. The history is institutional knowledge.

### **🔧 Academy Exception**
Academy develops and maintains the kanban system: it may change kanban infrastructure and diagnose or fix any team's board. It may NOT implement other teams' items or use oversight to bypass boundaries for non-kanban work. ("The iOS board isn't displaying" → Academy. "Fix this iOS crash" → iOS.)

