## 🎯 Pull Request Guidelines

Title: `<Type>: <Clear descriptive title>` (e.g. `Bugfix: Fix crash in data reload when no item selected`).
Description sections: Summary, Changes Made (per file), Impact (files/lines), Risk Assessment (HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW), Testing Recommendations (manual + regression), Breaking Changes, Checklist (compiles, no lint warnings, follows standards, self-reviewed).

