## 🧪 Testing Guidelines

**No PR opens until:** it builds, lint passes with zero NEW warnings, unit tests pass (when appropriate), the app launches, affected features are tested manually, and the console is checked.

| Platform | Lint | Tests |
|---|---|---|
| iOS/Swift | `swiftlint` | Cmd+U in Xcode |
| Android/Kotlin | `./gradlew ktlintCheck` · `./gradlew lint` | `./gradlew test` |
| Firebase/TS · JS/Node | `npm run lint` (or `npx eslint .`) | `npm test` |

**Write unit tests for:** new business logic or utilities, bug fixes (regression tests), data processing and validation, API/service changes, complex conditionals. **May skip for:** pure UI/layout, config, docs, simple copy changes.

